      <activity id="a6645cea-e9d5-5b90-8472-354b8171e85d" activityNameId="7372fb52-eebb-5308-ad06-9a704d68dcfa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Cooker hood, kitchen, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Cooker hood, kitchen, at regional storage
na;
UUID: b89687a8-edd7-3df8-893a-b6337429751e
This data set includes the production of a kitchen cooker hood with chromium steel cover. The production takes place in italy. Transport to a regional storage in Switzerland is included. The cooker hood has a weight of 21 kg. 60% of the material can be recycled at the end of life. The life span is approximately 15 years. The use of the cooker hood consumes 360 W/h (producer"s information). Transport to the construction site and mounting are not included.; Geography: Usage in Switzerland. Production takes place in Italy.
Location:  Usage in Switzerland. Production takes place in Italy.
Technology: Average production. Chromium steel cover.
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b89687a8-edd7-3df8-893a-b6337429751e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
